      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your vote is not a suggestion; it is a sacred duty to the community you inhabit. Abstaining is not apathy; it is an active surrender of your power to those who would govern without your consent. We have a moral imperative to participate, because silence in the face of poor leadership is complicity in its rise. Show up, because your civic participation is the bedrock of a just society.",
